  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>After collision, the balls change their directions of motion without changing the magnitudes of their velocity.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/26867412-10fb-4484-9067-7ec3333a104a-image.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 143px;\" /></p><p>Change in momentum of any one ball</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>&nbsp;The force exerted on the ball is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>av</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>005</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>av</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
